  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "#Joaquín Silva — Football Coach\r\n\r\nJoaquín's players each wear a performance tracker at practice. Every tracker sends readings to his tablet, which shows live workload numbers so he knows when to rest someone. The session uploads to the cloud afterwards.\r\n\r\n### What's Going Wrong?\r\n* The same players vanish from his display — always the ones working at the far end of the pitch.\r\n* When those players jog back toward the bench, they reappear.\r\n* The numbers he does get run several seconds behind what he's watching.\r\n* The app lists pods as out of range while he can see the players wearing them, right there on the pitch.",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "require_edit_to_continue": "true",
